#!medusa-plugin 1
# Does the network recover? Alternate short bursts of pressure with quiet
# windows and watch what the estate does in between.
#
# Declares tx, so the operator sees that before running it. Every tx step
# still passes the firmware TX guard: session, scope, rate and stop all
# apply, and a refusal stops this program rather than continuing.
id resilience-check
name Recovery Under Pressure
author hartle-tech
version 1
needs rx,tx,storage

> log baseline observation
> channel 6
> scan 5000
> repeat 3
>   log applying pressure
>   tx 0 200
>   log observing recovery
>   scan 8000
> end
> log resilience check complete
